<title>UK: Christies opens New York office.</title>
<headline>Christies opens New York office.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auctioneers Christies International Plc said on Thursday it had decided to establish a group office in New York.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Peter Blythe would join as group finance director effective January 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
